         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "NOD"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Though, I do fear that he was not acting alone.\\. There is still a lot of work to do for us.",
          "transl": "Та боюся, що він діяв не сам.\\. На нас іще чекає чимало роботи."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "guards.captain-male-oneleg",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "...",
          "transl": "..."
